// Game-wide quest tracking via KOTOR's own journal system -- covers all
// 9 planets (the _DONE/_PLOT globals above are Dantooine/Manaan-specific
// internal bookkeeping, not player-visible, so they aren't used as a
// location source; the journal is what the player actually sees update).
// GetJournalEntry(tag) reads the current stage for any quest, same
// reliability class as GetGlobalNumber -- a real, documented engine call,
// not a workaround. Reports nonzero stages every poll, same stateless
// pattern as CheckPlot(): the client tracks which (tag, stage) pairs it's
// already converted into a check.
void CheckJournal()
{
    int ntat18ac_dragonhunt = GetJournalEntry("tat18ac_dragonhunt");
    if (ntat18ac_dragonhunt > 0)
